  Entity Full Position (0x22) -- 18 bytes

    Fixed precision entity position and rotation.

      Fields

        type      value             notes
        int       entityID
        fixed27_5 x
        fixed27_5 y
        fixed27_5 z
        byte      rotation
        byte      rotation

      Example packet

        00 00 0f 47
        ff ff e2 cd
        00 00 08 04
        00 00 74 3a
        f9
        00


  Chunk Update Ann(?)  (0x32)

    Sent to the client when it has to load or unload a chunk, the data comes
    later (presumably)

      Fields

        type      value             notes
        int       chunk x
        int       chunk z
        bool      load              false to unload, true to load

      Example packet

        32
        ff ff ff f6
        00 00 00 27
        01

